#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:10
#: ba5d4873fdd0493faf5153b29d9fd4c5
msgid ""
"The HobbyKing HydroPro Inception is a high speed (over 11 m/s) electric "
"powerboat."
msgstr "HobbyKing HydroPro Inception 是一款高速（超过 11 m/s）电动快艇。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:13
#: befad8da585b4fbb80e97f230ae3de26
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:15
#: 3ec4c3bf36e14738bf08138fb20d7c23
msgid ""
"`HobbyKing HydroPro Inception <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/alpha-1000mm-"
"rtr.html>`__ (discontinued but the `Super Surge Crusher "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/super-surge-crusher-90a-twin-hull-brushless-r-"
"c-boat-730mm-arr.html>`__ may be similar)"
msgstr ""
"`HobbyKing HydroPro Inception <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/alpha-1000mm-"
"rtr.html>`__ （已停产，`Super Surge Crusher <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/super-"
"surge-crusher-90a-twin-hull-brushless-r-c-boat-730mm-arr.html>`__ 可能是类似替代品）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:16
#: 502c18d782a54fe9b1a6b3c1b24519c6
msgid ""
"two `Nano-Tech 4S 4000mAh batteries <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-"
"nano-tech-4000mah-4s-30c-lipo-pack-wxt60.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"两块 `Nano-Tech 4S 4000mAh 电池 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-nano-"
"tech-4000mah-4s-30c-lipo-pack-wxt60.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:17
#: fc5458a641a540e48003375d83c5e325
msgid ""
"`XT60 Y-cable <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/xt60-harness-for-2-packs-in-"
"parallel-1pc-2.html>`__ to connect batteries in parallel"
msgstr ""
"`XT60 并联 Y 型线 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/xt60-harness-for-2-packs-in-"
"parallel-1pc-2.html>`__，用于并联连接电池"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:18
#: 4959a03fc45547fba4abf1ae547b3f4a
msgid ""
"`Holybro Pixfalcon <http://www.holybro.com/product/8>`__ with `GPS "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/ublox-micro-m8n-gps-compass-module-1pc.html>`__"
" and `telemetry <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/holybro-telemetry-"
"radio-v3-100mw-915mhz.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Holybro Pixfalcon <http://www.holybro.com/product/8>`__，配 `GPS "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/ublox-micro-m8n-gps-compass-module-1pc.html>`__"
" 和 `数传 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/holybro-telemetry-"
"radio-v3-100mw-915mhz.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:19
#: 601369a468fb4ef59e17c0819f195071
msgid ""
"6 channel (or more) transmitter like the `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"6 通道（或更多）发射机，如 `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:21
#: 3e5876ece93140bc92d52663f114fc1d
msgid ""
"The inside of the vehicle becomes a bit wet during operation so it is "
"important to take steps to keep the electronics dry."
msgstr "车辆内部在运行时会有些进水，因此必须采取措施保持电子设备干燥。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:23
#: 51284a756cbe4af8963ec1b17490615c
msgid ""
"For this build a 3cm x 10cm rectangular hole was cut on the underside of the"
" removable cover which stretches from the blacked out windscreen at the "
"front to the black hook-like knob at the back.  The RC receiver, autopilot, "
"GPS and telemetry radio were inserted through the hole and then attached "
"using 3M double sided adhesive foam. The 3cm x 10cm hole was then closed "
"using duct tape."
msgstr ""
"本次组装在可拆卸舱盖底面（从前部磨砂挡风玻璃延伸至后部黑色钩形旋钮）开了一个 3cm x 10cm 的矩形孔。RC 接收机、飞控、GPS "
"和数传通过该孔插入，然后用 3M 双面泡棉胶固定。3cm x 10cm 的开孔随后用胶带封闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:25
#: b4b96cc5fe714e1f805c57d47797f78d
msgid ""
"The battery power module was left in the main open area of the frame but "
"partially protected from getting wet using a red balloon that came with the "
"set (intended for use with the RC receiver)."
msgstr "电池电源模块留在机架主开放区域，用套装附带的红色气球（原本用于 RC 接收机）进行部分防水保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:30
#: 0d62e5dd007541638395d42616d55b0f
msgid "Firmware used: Rover-3.5.0"
msgstr "固件版本：Rover-3.5.0"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:32
#: 1a63f04ac555454e8dcfbce9f8bc840e
msgid ""
"Parameter file: `HK-HydroProInception-Rover350.param "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/HK-"
"HydroProInception-Rover350.param>`__"
msgstr ""
"参数文件：`HK-HydroProInception-Rover350.param "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/HK-"
"HydroProInception-Rover350.param>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:34
#: 328aa9cb069f40d888dde64e553075b5
msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"HK-"
"HydroProInception-Rover350\" from the drop down on the middle right and then"
" push the \"Load Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"此参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的「Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree」页面加载，从右中部下拉菜单选择「HK-HydroProInception-Rover350」，然后点击「Load Presaved」按钮。"
